 ],
 "literal": "In the middle of the army camp that rose like the ocean, / burning with anger, biting his lips, turning his spearhead, / driving the crowd of soldiers, rising up, chasing and striking in the battle, / cleaving the oncoming army, blocking them to fall, / in the expanse of the middle army, being destroyed and separated, / having seen the greatness of the distinguished hero, like a waterfall, / the withered breasts (written as mountain) secreted, flowing with milk, / for the mother of the young hero of non-retreating determination!",
 "translation": "In the middle of the army camp that rose like the swelling ocean, burning with anger, biting his lips, and turning his spearhead, he drove the crowd of soldiers, rose up, and chased and struck them in battle. Cleaving the oncoming army and blocking them so they fell, he stood in the expanse of the middle army, destroyed and cut to pieces. Seeing the glorious greatness of this distinguished hero, the withered breasts of the mother of this young warrior of non-retreating determination swelled and secreted milk like a waterfall!",
 "modern": "கடல் போலக் கிளர்ந்து எழுந்த பாசறையின் நடுவே, சினத்தால் வெந்து உதட்டைக் கடித்து, தன் வேலின் முனையைத் திருப்பி, பகைவர் கூட்டத்தைச் செலுத்தி, எழுந்து வந்து, துரத்தி அடிக்கும் போர்க்களத்தில், எதிர்த்து வரும் படையைப் பிளந்து, அவர்கள் மடியுமாறு தடுத்து, இடைப்படையின் பரப்பில் தானும் சிதைந்து துண்டு துண்டாகி வீழ்ந்த சிறப்புடைய அவ்வீரனின் பெருமையைக் கண்டு, பின்வாங்காத மனவலிமை கொண்ட அந்த இளைஞனின் தாய்க்கு, வற்றிய அவளது முலைகள் நீர்வீழ்ச்சி போலப் பால் சுரந்தன.",
 "explanation": "The poet Avvaiyār describes the heroic death of a young warrior in the tumpai tiṇai (battle of strength) and the pride of his mother. The scene is set in the middle of a vast army camp that resembles a roaring ocean. The young hero fights fiercely, biting his lips in anger, turning his spear, and cleaving through the enemy ranks until he is cut to pieces in the thick of the battle. Upon seeing her son's glorious and heroic end on the battlefield, the mother's withered breasts miraculously secrete milk like a flowing waterfall. This powerful image of 'joyful weeping' (uvakaik kaluḻcci) highlights the supreme value placed on martial valour and maternal pride in classical Tamil society. Key words include 'kaṭṭūr' (army camp), 'ñāṭpiṉ' (battle), 'viṭalai' (young hero), and 'tāy' (mother).",
 "model": "gemini-3.5-flash",
